@startuml
title AdoteFácil - Backend (Diagrama de Componentes)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
left to right direction

actor "Client\n(Web/Mobile)" as Client

package "API (Express)" as API {
  [server.ts] as server
  [app.ts] as app
  [routes.ts] as routes
}

package "Middlewares" as MW {
  [user-auth.ts] as userauth
}

package "Application" as APP {
  [Controllers] as controllers
  [Services] as services
  [Repositories] as repos
}

package "Cross-cutting" as CC {
  [providers/authenticator.ts] as authenticator
  [providers/encrypter.ts] as encrypter
  [utils/either.ts\n(Success/Failure/Either)] as either
}

package "Persistence" as PERSIST {
  [database.ts] as database
  [Prisma Client] as prisma
  database "PostgreSQL" as pg
}


Client --> server : HTTP requests
server --> app : bootstrap
app --> routes : register routes
routes --> controllers : dispatch handlers

routes --> userauth : protected routes
userauth --> authenticator : verify token


controllers --> services : call use-cases
services --> repos : persistence operations


services --> encrypter : hash/compare password
services --> authenticator : sign token (JWT)
services --> either : return Success/Failure


app --> database : init db
database --> prisma : connect
prisma --> pg : DATABASE_URL

note right of controllers
Contém endpoints agrupados por domínio:
- user
- animal
- chat
end note

note right of services
Orquestra regras de negócio (use-cases):
- create/update user
- login
- create/update animal
- chats e mensagens
end note

note right of repos
Implementa acesso ao banco via Prisma:
- user
- animal
- animal-image
- chat
- user-message
end note

@enduml
